#: src/properties.py:195
#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:402
msgid "Bake a unit conversion to centimeters.\n\nRecommended for: Unreal, Unity, Godot\nNOTE: Unity and Godot use meters, but expect cenimters in FBX, or they will apply 100x scale to imported objects"
msgstr "烘焙单位换算为厘米。\n\n推荐用于：Unreal、Unity、Godot\n注意：Unity 和 Godot 使用米，但期望 FBX 中使用厘米，否则它们会对导入的物体应用 100 倍缩放"

