msgstr "烘焙从 Blender 默认单位（米）到其他长度单位的换算"

#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:419
msgid "Bake in rotation to make the scene Z-forward, Y-Up, X-Left, matching Maya's coordinate system. Avoids issues with importers (e.g. Unity, Godot) applying 90 degree rotations to objects and bones.\n\nRecommended for: Unity, Godot"
msgstr "烘焙旋转，使场景为 Z 轴向前、Y 轴向上、X 轴向左，与 Maya 坐标系一致。可避免导入器（如 Unity、Godot）对物体和骨骼应用 90 度旋转的问题。\n\n推荐用于：Unity、Godot"

#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:196
#: src/fbx_export/io_scene_fbx_5_2/__init__.py:88
msgid "Bake space transform into object data, avoids getting unwanted rotations to objects when target space is not aligned with Blender's space (WARNING! experimental option, use at own risk, known to be broken with armatures/animations)"
msgstr "将空间变换烘焙到物体数据中，避免目标空间与 Blender 空间不对齐时物体产生不需要的旋转（警告！实验性选项，使用风险自负，已知在骨架/动画下会失效）"

#: src/properties.py:215
msgid "Bake-in rotation to make the scene Z-forward, Y-Up, X-Left, matching Maya's coordinate system.\n\nRecommended for: Unity, Godot"
msgstr "烘焙旋转，使场景为 Z 轴向前、Y 轴向上、X 轴向左，与 Maya 坐标系一致。\n\n推荐用于：Unity、Godot"

