#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:440
msgid "By default, Blender exports the Armature object itself above the root bone. This is generally not desireable. If True, this option will remove it from the export.\n\nRecommended for: Unity, Godot.\n\nNOTE: If used without 'Bake Z Forward', may result in a rotated export.\n\nNOTE: Not recommended for Unreal, instead rename the Armature to 'Armature' to cause Unreal to remove it on-import"
msgstr "默认情况下，Blender 会将骨架物体本身导出到根骨骼上方。这通常并不理想。若为真，此选项会将其从导出中移除。\n\n推荐用于：Unity、Godot。\n\n注意：若不配合「烘焙 Z 轴向前」使用，可能导致导出结果被旋转。\n\n注意：不推荐用于 Unreal，而应将骨架重命名为 'Armature' 以让 Unreal 在导入时移除它"

