#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:628
msgid "When applying Modifiers, preserve Shape Keys on the Mesh.\n\nPotentially SLOW operation with many Shape Keys.\n\nEXPERIMENTAL: this is complicated and may have cases that do not work. Please report bugs with this option if you experience them."
msgstr "应用修改器时，保留网格上的形态键。\n\n形态键较多时可能非常慢。\n\n实验性：此功能较复杂，可能存在无法正常工作的情况。如遇到问题请报告此选项的错误。"

#: src/properties.py:250
msgid "When applying Modifiers, preserve Shape Keys on the mesh.\n\nPotentially SLOW operation with many Shape Keys.\n\nEXPERIMENTAL: this is complicated and may have cases that do not work. Please report bugs with this option if you experience them."
msgstr "应用修改器时，保留网格上的形态键。\n\n形态键较多时可能非常慢。\n\n实验性：此功能较复杂，可能存在无法正常工作的情况。如遇到问题请报告此选项的错误。"

