msgstr "将动作导出为 FBX 动画时，其文件名使用的格式"

#: src/properties.py:300
msgid "When exporting Actions, force frame range to be at least 2 frames long.\n\nAvoids a Blender FBX export bug where no keys are exported for 1 frame animations. Recommended to always leave this enabled"
msgstr "导出动作时，强制帧范围至少为 2 帧。\n\n避免 Blender FBX 导出的一个错误：单帧动画不会导出任何关键帧。建议始终保持启用"

#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:454
msgid "When exporting Actions, force frame range to be at least 2 frames long.\nFixes import issue with Unreal, where it cannot import 1 frame animations"
msgstr "导出动作时，强制帧范围至少为 2 帧。\n修复 Unreal 的导入问题：它无法导入单帧动画"

#: src/properties.py:167
msgid "When exporting all Actions, save each action to its own FBX file. Each file will be named after the Action's name"
msgstr "导出所有动作时，将每个动作保存到单独的 FBX 文件。每个文件以动作名称命名"

#: src/properties.py:360
msgid "When exporting an Armature with animation, Shape Key animation of deformed Meshes is detected and converted to Custom Property curves on the Armature root bone.\n\nRecommended for: Unreal.\nNote: Unity can import these curves, but will not automatically apply them to Blendshape animation"
msgstr "导出带动画的骨架时，检测变形网格的形态键动画并转换为骨架根骨骼上的自定义属性曲线。\n\n推荐用于：Unreal。\n注意：Unity 可以导入这些曲线，但不会自动将其应用于混合变形动画"

#: src/properties.py:361
msgid "When exporting an Armature with animation, Shape Key animation of deformed Meshes is detected and converted to Shape Key curves on a dummy mesh. Allows for real FBX blendshape curves while keeping filesize down.\n\nRecommended for: Unity, Godot"
msgstr "导出带动画的骨架时，检测变形网格的形态键动画并转换为虚拟网格上的形态键曲线。可保留真实的 FBX 混合变形曲线，同时减小文件体积。\n\n推荐用于：Unity、Godot"

#: src/properties.py:307
#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:461
msgid "When exporting armatures and actions, remove all scaling from bones.\n\nTIP: if you see innacurate animations after export, it is often the result of scaled bones. This option can be used to work around rigs that producing scaled bones"
msgstr "导出骨架和动作时，移除骨骼上的所有缩放。\n\n提示：如果导出后动画不准确，通常是骨骼缩放导致的。此选项可用于绕过会产生缩放骨骼的绑定"

#: src/properties.py:320
#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:468
msgid "When exporting armatures and actions, set all bones' parents to the given root bone.\n\nTIP: Useful if you want to do squash/stretch bone scaling in a game engine. A flat hierarchy avoids distorted transforms resulting from scaled bone chains, but is not recommended under normal circumstances"
msgstr "导出骨架和动作时，将所有骨骼的父级设为指定的根骨骼。\n\n提示：如果要在游戏引擎中做挤压/拉伸骨骼缩放，此选项很有用。扁平层级可避免缩放骨骼链导致的变换扭曲，但正常情况下不建议使用"

#: src/properties.py:595
msgid "When true, Set Timeline will ignore a frame on frame zero, and set the start to frame one instead. Useful when previewing looping animations.\n\nNOTE: Quick Export functions will still export the full frame-range of the action"
msgstr "启用时，设置时间轴将忽略第零帧，改为从第一帧开始。预览循环动画时很有用。\n\n注意：快速导出功能仍会导出动作的完整帧范围"

#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:567
msgid "When using 'From Armature as Props' Shape Key animation export, scale applied to exported curves.\n\nCan be used to compensate for importers that expect values of 0-100 instead of 0-1"
msgstr "使用“从骨架作为属性”形态键动画导出时，应用于导出曲线的缩放。\n\n可用于补偿期望 0-100 而非 0-1 值的导入器"

#: src/properties.py:327
#: src/fbx_export/proto_fbx_init.py:475
msgid "When using Flat Bone Hierarchy, name of the bone to treat as the root.\nLeave blank to make all bones have no parent (making the Armature itself the root)"
msgstr "使用扁平骨骼层级时，作为根骨骼处理的骨骼名称。\n留空则所有骨骼均无父级（使骨架本身成为根）"

#: src/properties.py:159
